{
 "component": "collector-host-sbom",
 "title": "Platform facts and package lines of linux, macOS, OpenWrt, Android and Windows hosts become the inventory/v1 documents (host-packages, host-platforms) and per-ecosystem metrics; incomplete package lines are skipped, a missing source defaults to the package, firmware build time becomes a UTC date; no os.family is a gap, no package an info finding, sbom: false skips, sbom_paths needs a local exec adapter (narrow fs-sbom gap)",
 "contract": "collector-protocol/1.0 / inventory/v1",
 "origin": "collectors/host-sbom/collector.py; docs/design.md (inventory/v1)",
